==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 10~26.67 seconds<sup>300f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~26.67 seconds<sup>300f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**8 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~4 seconds<sup>30f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Simply spam [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]] for an easy victory.

